From c3b936044d68c4067c3f495ddbb06b1a2cf4c0ce Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xCollxn <81695022+xCollxn@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 00:40:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 03/11] configure.sh: DACAI panel option; DACAI guide (EN/TR)

Kconfig menu "Display panel" selects DACAI (PETREL_DACAI) and its host UART
speed (PETREL_DACAI_BAUD: 115200/230400/460800/921600). docs/dacai.md and
docs/dacai_TR.md describe recognition, setup, uploaded pictures, recovery
after a microSD update, limits and the protocol differences.
